### Comment ###
EFHW-8010 end-fed half-wave for 80-10 m as an inverted V, fed through a 49:1 unun: the source's Balun 49 (ideal, lossless), so the impedance and SWR shown are those the 50 ohm coax sees. The unun's own loss, often 0.5-1 dB, is not included.
Sommerwire SRC: 1, 49
